    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1004" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγχι-βᾰθής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
